<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<j:jelly xmlns:j="jelly:core">
  <div>
    Provisions ephemeral Jenkins agents as Namespace micro-VM instances.
    Define machine profiles once, label them, and jobs that ask for a label get
    a fresh instance for the build and nothing left running afterwards.
    <p>
      Community plugin. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by
      Namespace Labs.
    </p>
  </div>
</j:jelly>
